# Global gitignore - applies to EVERY repo on this machine.
#
# Symlinked to ~/.gitignore_global and wired up by .gitconfig:
#
#   [core]
#     excludesfile = ~/.gitignore_global
#
# Only put things here that are junk in any repo, anywhere. Anything specific to
# a project belongs in that project's own .gitignore - a pattern here silently
# affects every repo you touch, and there's no indication in the project that
# it's happening.

# MacOS system files
.DS_Store
.Trashes
Icon? # The Icon\r file used by Finder (trailing CR)

# Tool caches that no project should ever commit
.bundle/
.nvm/
.npm/
.cache/

# Claude Code writes this into any project it's used in, and it's per-machine
**/.claude/settings.local.json
